Prize.\\n\\nNonfiction\\n\\nIn 2008, Atwood published Payback: Debt and the Shadow Side of Wealth, a collection of five lectures delivered as part of the Massey Lectures from October 12 to November 1, 2008. The book was released in ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Margaret_Atwood\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":false,\"ref\":\"d51\",\"snippet\":\" ... Winner of the Man Booker International Prize.\\n\\nAccessible editions: DB\\n\\nSantiago, Chile. The city is covered in ash. Three children of ex-militants are facing a past they can neither remember nor forget. Felipe sees dead bodies on every corner in the city, counting them up in an ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nypl.org/spotlight/world-literature-festival/recommended-translations\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":true,\"ref\":\"d22\",\"snippet\":\" ... Doubleday authors have been awarded 34 Pulitzer Prizes, 12 National Book Awards, 30 National Book Critics Circle Awards, 6 Man Booker Prizes, and 3 Nobel Prizes. In 2011, the London Book Fair presented him with a Lifetime Achievement Award for his work in international publishing.\\n\\nBorn in India ... \",\"title\":\"https://centerforfiction.org/grants-awards/medal-for-editorial-excellence/medal-for-editorial-excellence-past-recipients/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":false,\"ref\":\"d53\",\"snippet\":\" ... English novelist Pat Barker was born in 1943. She is the author of the prize-winning Regeneration trilogy. The last book in the series, The Ghost Road, won the Booker Prize in 1995. Her latest novel, The Silence of the Girls, was shortlisted for the 2019 Women's ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbc.ca/books/30-books-to-celebrate-30-years-of-writers-company-1.5755144\"}],\"query\":\"International Booker Prize 2019 winner author born city\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_d746219484064a88a08906bc"},{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle. The key is \"the year in which this book was published\" in the 2010s, and another book released the preceding year won the award. Let me think about the International Booker Prize winners and the timing.\n\nThe International Booker Prize (reconfigured 2016) awards a book published in the preceding year. Let me look at the winners and find a book translated into 25+ languages that was a contender.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"International Booker Prize winners 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 list\", \"Man Booker International Prize winners list 2016 2017 2018 2019\", \"International Booker Prize shortlist 2017 2018 2019 translated 25 languages\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_39ee29d3cba8465ebdc569d9","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Olga Tokarczuk Flights translated 25 languages International Booker Prize\", \"Flights Olga Tokarczuk languages translated published year\", \"Drive Your Plow Olga Tokarczuk translated languages published\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_074d555cbdc94459bfa8f8d7","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":false,\"ref\":\"d56\",\"snippet\":\" ... Award, 2017\\n\\n- Raymond Chandler Award, 2017\\n\\n- Academy Board of Directors' Tribute, 2018\\n\\n- UCD Ulysses Medal, 2018\\n\\n- Adrienne Clarkson Prize for Global Citizenship, 2018\\n\\n- Order of the Companions of Honour, 2018\\n\\n- LARB/UCR Lifetime Achievement Award, 2019\\n\\n- VH1 Trailblazer Honoree, 2019\\n\\n- The Booker Prize for The Testaments, 2019\\n\\n- Burke ... \",\"title\":\"https://margaretatwood.ca/awards-recognitions/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"previously_received\":true,\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... Goes Last (2015) (Winner of the 2015 Red Tentacle award)\\n* Hag-Seed (2016) (Longlisted for the 2017 Women Prize for